OL,3,AMarvel fans to meet Welsh superhero -
OL,4,Acomplete with Cardiff accent
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,7,Fdetails from the VisionQuest series
OL,9,FMarvel fans around the world are set to
OL,10,Fmeet a Welsh villain - complete with a
OL,11,FCardiff accent.
OL,13,FLauren Morais, from the Welsh capital,
OL,14,Fwill play Lisa Molinari in the new
OL,15,Fsuperhero series VisionQuest - a
OL,16,Fspin-off from the miniseries
OL,17,FWandaVision.
OL,19,FThe Disney+ show, exploring whether AI
OL,20,Fand humanity can co-exist, also stars
OL,21,FPaul Bettany, returning as Vision, and
OL,22,FJames Spader as Ultron.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
